      <a class="html-expand html-figpopup" data-counterslinkmanual="https://www.mdpi.com/1996-1073/15/10/3789/display" href="https://www.mdpi.com/1996-1073/15/10/3789#fig_body_display_energies-15-03789-f007"></a>
